    "media:imagetext": "Taxi, Take-off, \u0026 Landing\n*1. RA\nEmergency exits\nKnow the location and\noperation of all exits.\nUsing the exits, quickly\nevacuate the aircraft.\nBefore opening an exit,\nquickly look through a\nwindow to check outside\nfor the following:\nA\nSmoke\nIf smoke is so thick you\ncan not see out, redirect\npassengers to other exits.\nFire\nB\nIf there is fire outside\nthe aircraft, redirect\npassengers to other exits.\nDebris\nExit\nIf there is metal debris or\nobstructions, redirect\npassengers to other exits.\nFollow lights to exits.\n37408\nLUIS\nC\nBrace positions\n#*7*",
